Subject: [PATCH] [FlyDSL] Add hc_mix kernel for Qwen3.8 hyper-connections

aiter.ops.flydsl.hc_mix fuses Qwen3.8's hyper-connection input mix (down
GEMM, SiLU, up GEMM, sigmoid) for gfx950, up to 128 rows.

From amd-nprotaso/aiter qwen_3_8_improvement: 9d398dc8, e5fd075e, a4909abc.
